+
+| Kind | HP | Speed | Appearance |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| Basic | 3 | 95px/s | Original purple square |
+| Runner | 2 | 140px/s | Orange diamond with R |
+| Guard | 7 | 65px/s | Larger blue-gray body, shield, and G |
